// gh-1121: whole-chain transient outage — the exhausted-chain tail with only
// transient attempt evidence. Auth text (401) must not classify here: a resume
// can never fix credentials. (403 / quota vocabulary are excluded earlier by
// the quota branch's priority — I1.)
var AUTH_CODE_RE = /\b401\b/;

// gh-1121: provider/model + code extraction for the honest reset comment.
