Where is providerOutageOf defined? Next to classifyInterruptedText/quotaClassificationOf... but recoverMissingResponse at line ~699 uses it — function declarations are hoisted in GralJS/JS, so placement anywhere top-level works. I'll define providerOutageOf next to quotaClassificationOf for cohesion, and use it in recoverMissingResponse (hoisting handles order).

Also — wait, one more thing: `quotaContextOf(ctx, ...)` when ctx is null builds a minimal object; the bug leg passes a fresh quotaGateContextOf object. Setting providerOutage there is harmless.

